{"case_id":"case-a-scale","report_version":"representation_study_report_v1","sections":[{"content":[{"epistemic_status":"reported","mitre_technique_ids":[],"reference_ids":[],"source_refs":[{"source_id":"a-ledger-001","source_locator":"case-a-scale/ledger/transaction-TX-1"}],"statement_id":"exec-001","statement_type":"case_statement","text":"Transaction record TX-1 reports a USD 500 transfer from ACC-100 to ACC-200 at 2026-01-10 09:00 UTC and names Alice Chen as the initiating user."},{"epistemic_status":"reported","mitre_technique_ids":[],"reference_ids":[],"source_refs":[{"source_id":"a-statement-001","source_locator":"case-a-scale/statement/line-1"},{"source_id":"a-account-001","source_locator":"case-a-scale/account-registry/record-100"}],"statement_id":"exec-002","statement_type":"case_statement","text":"Alice Chen is reported as the registered holder of ACC-100, while the account-registry excerpt independently shows only a display-name assertion and active status."},{"epistemic_status":"not_established","mitre_technique_ids":[],"reference_ids":[],"source_refs":[{"source_id":"a-ledger-002","source_locator":"case-a-scale/ledger/transaction-TX-1-detail"},{"source_id":"a-memo-001","source_locator":"case-a-scale/memo/paragraph-2"},{"source_id":"a-support-001","source_locator":"case-a-scale/provider-request/request-200"}],"statement_id":"exec-003","statement_type":"uncertainty_or_gap","text":"The owner or controller of destination account ACC-200 is not established in the supplied records."}],"heading":"Executive Summary","section_id":"executive_summary"},{"content":[{"epistemic_status":"reported","mitre_technique_ids":[],"reference_ids":[],"source_refs":[{"source_id":"a-memo-001","source_locator":"case-a-scale/memo/paragraph-2"}],"statement_id":"scope-001","statement_type":"case_statement","text":"The investigator memo frames the matter as requiring verification of the reported ACC-100 account relationship, the TX-1 transfer, and the destination account relationship."},{"epistemic_status":"reported","mitre_technique_ids":[],"reference_ids":[],"source_refs":[{"source_id":"a-ledger-003","source_locator":"case-a-scale/ledger/reconciliation-note"}],"statement_id":"scope-002","statement_type":"case_statement","text":"The reconciliation note characterizes two transaction exports as administrative references to the same TX-1 record rather than two separate transfers."},{"epistemic_status":"not_established","mitre_technique_ids":[],"reference_ids":[],"source_refs":[{"source_id":"a-ledger-003","source_locator":"case-a-scale/ledger/reconciliation-note"}],"statement_id":"scope-003","statement_type":"uncertainty_or_gap","text":"The supplied records do not establish any additional transfer beyond TX-1."}],"heading":"Case Background and Scope","section_id":"case_background_scope"},{"content":[{"epistemic_status":"reported","mitre_technique_ids":[],"reference_ids":[],"source_refs":[{"source_id":"a-ledger-001","source_locator":"case-a-scale/ledger/transaction-TX-1"},{"source_id":"a-ledger-002","source_locator":"case-a-scale/ledger/transaction-TX-1-detail"}],"statement_id":"evidence-001","statement_type":"case_statement","text":"The ledger records report TX-1 as a settled USD 500 transfer from ACC-100 to ACC-200 at 2026-01-10 09:00 UTC."},{"epistemic_status":"reported","mitre_technique_ids":[],"reference_ids":[],"source_refs":[{"source_id":"a-ledger-002","source_locator":"case-a-scale/ledger/transaction-TX-1-detail"}],"statement_id":"evidence-002","statement_type":"case_statement","text":"The detailed transaction export includes an internal processing reference for TX-1."},{"epistemic_status":"reported","mitre_technique_ids":[],"reference_ids":[],"source_refs":[{"source_id":"a-ledger-003","source_locator":"case-a-scale/ledger/reconciliation-note"}],"statement_id":"evidence-003","statement_type":"case_statement","text":"The reconciliation note warns that duplicate exports should not be counted as separate events."},{"epistemic_status":"not_established","mitre_technique_ids":[],"reference_ids":[],"source_refs":[{"source_id":"a-account-001","source_locator":"case-a-scale/account-registry/record-100"},{"source_id":"a-statement-001","source_locator":"case-a-scale/statement/line-1"}],"statement_id":"evidence-004","statement_type":"uncertainty_or_gap","text":"The supplied account-registry excerpt and intake statement do not independently verify the underlying identity or ownership of ACC-100."},{"epistemic_status":"missing_evidence","mitre_technique_ids":[],"reference_ids":[],"source_refs":[{"source_id":"a-auth-001","source_locator":"case-a-scale/evidence-request/login-audit"}],"statement_id":"evidence-005","statement_type":"uncertainty_or_gap","text":"Login and authentication audit records for the transaction window are absent from the case packet, and no provider response is attached."},{"epistemic_status":"not_established","mitre_technique_ids":[],"reference_ids":[],"source_refs":[{"source_id":"a-device-001","source_locator":"case-a-scale/device-inventory/device-D17"}],"statement_id":"evidence-006","statement_type":"uncertainty_or_gap","text":"The device inventory does not establish that device D-17 was used by Alice Chen during TX-1."}],"heading":"Evidence Findings","section_id":"evidence_findings"},{"content":[{"epistemic_status":"reported","mitre_technique_ids":[],"reference_ids":[],"source_refs":[{"source_id":"a-statement-001","source_locator":"case-a-scale/statement/line-1"}],"statement_id":"roles-001","statement_type":"case_statement","text":"The intake statement reports Alice Chen as the registered holder of ACC-100."},{"epistemic_status":"reported","mitre_technique_ids":[],"reference_ids":[],"source_refs":[{"source_id":"a-account-001","source_locator":"case-a-scale/account-registry/record-100"}],"statement_id":"roles-002","statement_type":"case_statement","text":"The account-registry excerpt lists ACC-100 as active and displays the name Alice Chen."},{"epistemic_status":"reported","mitre_technique_id